Dana Morin wrote:

Hi Eric,

 I used it for a mark-resight model with lions a couple years ago (Kane et al. 2015). I've attached the paper <https://doi.org/10.1007/s10531-015-1012-7> and the supplementary appendix with the code (show the code for both marked and unmarked components). Hope that helps!

